«
@@ ============================================================
@@ LightTime — One-Way Light Time (OWLT) & Round-Trip Time (RTT) to a planet
@@ Editable Function-Library example (Jean Wilson's OWLT/RTT idea).
@@ Type 1-7 (or 0 to quit), ENTER to push it, then = to run. Computes today's
@@ Earth-to-target distance with DAToB, then OWLT = d/c and RTT = 2·d/c. Displays
@@ them and also leaves them tagged on the stack (Target/Distance/OWLT/RTT).
@@ An invitation to build your own RPL program from the astronomy library.
@@ To extend: add a label, an element function 'Ⓛ…Φf', and a table row.
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ ============================================================
  DEPTH → d0
  «
    CLLCD
    "   OWLT / RTT to a planet" 1 DISP
    "1 Mercury  2 Venus  3 Mars" 3 DISP
    "4 Jupiter  5 Saturn" 4 DISP
    "6 Uranus   7 Neptune" 5 DISP
    "0 = Quit" 6 DISP
    "Pick, ENTER, then =" 7 DISP
    HALT
    IF DEPTH d0 > THEN
      → n
      «
        IF n 0 ≠ THEN
          IF n 1 ≥ n 7 ≤ AND THEN
            DateTime JDN → jd
            «
              jd Ⓛ♁Pf
              jd { 'Ⓛ☿Φf' 'Ⓛ♀Φf' 'Ⓛ♂Φf' 'Ⓛ♃Φf' 'Ⓛ♄Φf' 'Ⓛ⛢Φf' 'Ⓛ♆Φf' } n GET EVAL ⓁPosΦf
              ⓁDAToB
              DUP Ⓒc / 1_min CONVERT
              → d owlt
              «
                { "Mercury" "Venus" "Mars" "Jupiter" "Saturn" "Uranus" "Neptune" } n GET → name
                «
                  CLLCD
                  "Target: " name + 1 DISP
                  "Distance: " d + 3 DISP
                  "OWLT = " owlt + 5 DISP
                  "RTT  = " owlt 2 · + 6 DISP
                  "Press any key" 7 DISP
                  -1 WAIT DROP
                  name "Target" →Tag
                  d "Distance" →Tag
                  owlt "OWLT" →Tag
                  owlt 2 · "RTT" →Tag
                »
              »
            »
          ELSE
            CLLCD
            "Invalid choice." 3 DISP
            "Enter 1-7, or 0 to quit." 4 DISP
            "Press any key" 6 DISP
            -1 WAIT DROP
          END
        END
      »
    END
  »
»
